    <h2>Choose your power at the handlebar</h2>
    <p>On a tight trail, you can select low power from the handlebar and switch to medium or high as the terrain opens up. There’s no clutch to work when you slow for a turn. The 72V system feeds a mid-mounted motor rated for 6 kW continuous and 13 kW peak. Those figures describe the motor’s output. Traction, rider weight and the terrain all affect how the bike accelerates.</p>
