    <h2>Plan your range around the route</h2>
    <p>At 72V and 41Ah, the removable battery has 2.952 kWh of nominal energy. Use the stated Eco range as a starting point for a trail loop, with charge in reserve for the ride back. Long climbs, soft ground, cold weather and higher speeds can all shorten the distance. Back home, you can remove the pack and charge it with the supplied 18A charger.</p>
