    <h2>Set the chassis up for the way you ride</h2>
    <p>The 60 kg T-02 uses an aluminum alloy frame, a 19-inch front wheel and a 17-inch rear wheel. The larger front wheel helps roll over roots and ruts. You can adjust rear shock compression, rebound and preload, and set the brake lever reach to suit your hands.</p>
    <p>When comparing a high-performance electric dirt bike, check the parts you’ll use and maintain every ride: suspension, brakes, tires and chain. Follow the owner’s manual for routine care and <a href="{{ pages.contact.url | default: '/pages/contact' }}">ask Panquire about compatible replacement parts</a>.</p>
